{"projectInfo":{"name":"BGP Public AS Only","path":"bgp_public_as_only","visibility":2,"categoryId":40,"introduction":"私有AS号是内部使用的AS号，范围为64512～65535（旧规范）。私有AS号主要用于测试网络，一般情况下不需要在公共网络中传播。对公网EBGP邻居传递时，可以通过public-as-only命令去掉私有AS号。peer public-as-only命令用来配置向指定EBGP对等体/对等体组发送BGP更新消息时只携带公有AS号，不携带私有AS号。","label":["BGP"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"AS65002","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS65002.cfg"},{"resourceName":"AS65001","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS65001.cfg"},{"resourceName":"AS20","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS20.cfg"},{"resourceName":"AS10","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS10.cfg"}]}